return [['How do I find properties?', 'Use the homepage search or browse the property pages. Filter by category, district, city and price, then open a listing to see its details.'], ['Can I browse properties for rent?', 'Yes. Open Properties for rent from the Properties menu. Rental prices are shown per month when a price is available.'], ['How do I save a property?', 'Sign in with a buyer account and use Save property on its detail page. You can find saved listings in your buyer dashboard.'], ['How do I contact the team about a property?', 'Open the listing and use its contact options. Include the property reference so the team can identify the listing.'], ['How do I advertise my property?', 'Create an account or sign in, open My profile and enable seller access. Add your property details and photos, then submit the listing for review.'], ['What do Basic and Silver verification mean?', 'The verification rankings page explains the checks for each level. A listing badge shows its current level; it is separate from being selected as a Featured property.'], ['Does an inspection request confirm an appointment?', 'No. The team contacts you to agree the scope and arrangements. A preferred date is a request, not a confirmed appointment.'], ['Can I request help for a site that is not listed?', 'For an LGC service request, you can provide your site location instead of a property reference. Tell the team what work you need.'], ['Can I enquire from outside Sri Lanka?', 'Yes. Contact the team by email or the contact options shown on the website. Include your country, time zone and preferred contact time.'], ['How do I reset my password?', 'Choose Forgot password on the sign-in page and enter your account email. Check your inbox and spam folder for the reset message.'], ['Which languages are available?', 'Public website navigation and interface text are available in English, Sinhala and Tamil. Property descriptions and company profile text are shown as supplied.']];
